<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>INDIA, July 5 - Kandla - Nine cargo vessels and seven oil vessels berthed alongside. 23 Cargo vessels and six liquid vessels anchored off kandla roads awaiting berths. Five vessels working in stream.</p>
</text>
